WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
Europe is in serious trouble.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.560
They've been invaded by a force of illegal aliens

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:07.640
like nobody's ever seen before.

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:10.160
Illegal aliens are pouring into Europe.

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:14.000
Nobody has ever — and nobody is doing anything to change it,

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:14.600
to get them out.

